00:34:06.163 --> 00:34:22.995
Async normally follows within milliseconds, but under a 200,000-row burst the lag peaked at ~16 MB of un-replayed WAL, that un-streamed WAL is exactly what you'd lose if the primary vanished at that instant (RPO 0).

