00:35:05.965 --> 00:35:13.218
Prove that a failure in a non-critical dependency won't breach the product-page SLO, before an outage tests it for us.

512
00:35:13.498 --> 00:35:19.301
A product service depends on a non-critical recommendations service over real HTTP.

513
00:35:19.581 --> 00:35:32.466
Four game-day experiments (slow, errors, crash, recovery) run with the Ch 18 patterns off versus on, checking the hypothesis p99 300 ms and errors 1%.

514
00:35:33.816 --> 00:35:36.717
