00:40:48.710 --> 00:41:06.054
Checkout page dependencies (core = the purchase cannot complete without it): catalog (product data) CORE. inventory (stock) CORE. payment gateway CORE. recommendations degradable, then hide the 'you may also like' row. reviews or ratings degradable,

