561
00:41:34.560 --> 00:41:50.645
The drill caught two failures that both reported success: a truncated backup (disk filled mid-copy) failed pgrestore, and an orphaned backup restored cleanly but failed the post-restore row-count verification (retention had pruned referenced data).

562
00:41:50.925 --> 00:41:52.611
